{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000004", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "突然发生,造成或者可能造成严重社会危害,需要采取应急处置措施予以应对的自然灾害、事故灾难、公共卫生事件和社会安全事件。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@3.1", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000005", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "针对可能发生的突发事件,为最大程度减少突发事件及其造成的危害而预先制定的方案。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@3.2", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000006", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "识别可能存在的危险因素,分析突发事件可能产生的直接后果以及次生、衍生后果,评估各种后果的危害程度和影响范围的全过程。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@3.3", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000007", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "调查本地区、本单位能够调用的应急力量、物资装备、场所等应急资源状况和合作区域内可以请求援助的应急资源状况。", "knowledge_type": "permission", "normative_force": "permitted", "source_modality": "可以", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@3.4", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000008", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "应急预案编制遵循以下原则。\n\n- **a)** 合规性:依据法律法规和政策文件制定应急预案,按照程序审批发布,根据法律法规的修订或政策调整,及时修订预案内容,保持与现行要求的一致。\n- **b)** 科学性:基于风险评估、应急资源调查和案例分析结果,运用科学的理论和方法编制应急预案,明确应急预案的定位,做到相互衔接。\n- **c)** 针对性:根据特定的突发事件类型、风险源和应急资源状况,制定具体的应急处置措施,明确响应主体及职责任务。\n- **d)** 可操作性:应急处置流程和操作步骤明晰具体,定期组织应急预案的演练和评估,及时发现和解决问题,不断改进和完善。", "knowledge_type": "responsibility", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@4", "pdf_page": 3, "printed_page": null, "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}, {"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@4", "pdf_page": 7, "printed_page": "1", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}, {"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@4", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000009", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "应急预案按照制定主体划分,分为政府及其部门应急预案、单位和基层组织应急预案两类。应急预案分类图见图1。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@5.1", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000010", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "政府及其部门应急预案包括县级以上政府及其部门应急预案、乡镇(街道)应急预案。县级以上政府及其部门应急预案包括总体应急预案、专项应急预案和部门应急预案,其中由政府及其有关部门编制的重要目标保护应急预案和重大活动保障应急预案属于政府专项或部门应急预案。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@5.2", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000011", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "单位和基层组织应急预案包括企事业单位、村 (社区 )、应急救援队伍、社会组织等编制的应急预案。\n\n> 注:社会组织中承担应急救援任务的,应急预案按照应急救援队伍编写,不承担应急救援任务的,应急预案按照企事业单位编写。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@5.3", "pdf_page": 8, "printed_page": "2", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000012", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "应急预案编制流程包括准备阶段、预案编写阶段、审批发布备案阶段、评估改进阶段共4个阶段,编制流程图见图2。\n\n> 注:虚框为可选动作。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": ["活动筹备"], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.1", "pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": "3", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000013", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "成立应急预案编制工作组,确定工作组组长和组员,明确工作组的任务分工。参加人员应包括相关部门和单位人员、有关专家及有现场处置与救援经验的人员等。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "应", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": ["活动期间"], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.2.1", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000014", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "梳理搜集应急预案编制的法律法规、标准、规范、上级应急预案等相关资料,并结合实际开展风险评估、资源调查、案例分析等工作,具体内容如下。\n\n- **a)** 识别突发事件风险及其可能产生的后果和次生、衍生灾害事件,可通过情景构建评估可能造成的危害程度和影响范围等。\n- **b)** 调查本地区、本单位应对突发事件可用的应急队伍、装备、物资、场所和通过改造可以利用的应急资源状况,合作区域内可请求援助的应急资源状况,重要基础设施容灾保障及备用状况,以及可通过潜力转换提供应急资源的状况。\n- **c)** 对典型突发事件的发生演化规律、造成的后果和处置救援情况进行复盘研究。应按照GB/T 46791进行案例分析。", "knowledge_type": "requirement", "normative_force": "recommended", "source_modality": "应", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": ["恢复"], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.2.2", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000015", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "编制预案大纲,按照分工编制各个章节。编制过程中可针对全流程或关键环节开展桌面推演,形成应急预案的初稿。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.3.1", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000016", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "组织召开小组会议,对应急预案内容进行讨论修改,达成统一意见,形成征求意见稿及编制说明等材料。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.3.2", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000017", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "广泛听取意见,组织有关专家进行论证,与相关应急预案衔接。涉及其他单位职责的,书面征求意见。可向社会公开征求意见,根据征求意见情况修改应急预案内容,形成征求意见汇总表,并说明不采纳意见的理由。", "knowledge_type": "permission", "normative_force": "permitted", "source_modality": "可", "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.3.3", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000018", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "应急预案编制工作组或牵头单位将应急预案文本、征求意见汇总表、编制说明等有关材料报送应急预案审批单位,按程序发布,按规定要求进行备案。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.4", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000019", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "应急预案编制完成后对应急预案所涉及的单位、人员、装备、设施等组织演练,通过演练和实施发现问题,修改完善应急预案。", "knowledge_type": "fact", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@6.5", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
{"schema_version": "1.0.0", "knowledge_id": "K-GBT46793.1-2025-000020", "doc_id": "GBT46793.1-2025", "statement": "县级以上政府总体应急预案内容包括但不限于:\n\n- **a)** 突发事件应对总体要求;\n- **b)** 适用范围;\n- **c)** 突发事件分类分级;\n- **d)** 预案体系构成;\n- **e)** 组织指挥体系构成与职责;\n- **f)** 风险防控要求;\n- **g)** 监测预警职责和要求;\n- **h)** 分级响应要求;\n- **i)** 信息发布与舆论引导要求;\n- **j)** 应急保障措施;\n- **k)** 预案管理要求。", "knowledge_type": "responsibility", "normative_force": "informational", "source_modality": null, "conditions": [], "actors": [], "objects": [], "actions": [], "applicable_stages": [], "topics": ["信息发布", "应急管理"], "scenarios": [], "source_refs": [{"node_id": "GBT46793.1-2025@7.1.1.1", "pdf_page": 10, "printed_page": "4", "source_file": "source/original.pdf"}], "derivation": "extractive", "confidence": 0.95, "verification_status": "page_aligned"}
